{
  "movie_id": 513700401,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 2.7,
      "end_time": 4.2,
      "text": "Kusano Yui...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 5.4,
      "end_time": 6.6,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 7.6,
      "end_time": 9.0,
      "text": "I'm sorry..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 9.4,
      "end_time": 11.6,
      "text": "I was just worried..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 12.5,
      "end_time": 13.7,
      "text": "...Don't be so conceited."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 14.0,
      "end_time": 18.4,
      "text": "Even at this stage, going this far to say things people want to hear...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 19.8,
      "end_time": 21.6,
      "text": "...It's true."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 22.2,
      "end_time": 25.3,
      "text": "I've been hurting you this entire time."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 25.6,
      "end_time": 29.5,
      "text": "I know I'd just be a nuisance worrying about you."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 30.5,
      "end_time": 32.4,
      "text": "...But, even so."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 32.6,
      "end_time": 34.7,
      "text": "I want to look out for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 35.3,
      "end_time": 36.3,
      "text": "After all..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 36.5,
      "end_time": 40.2,
      "text": "You're not me. Because you're you..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 40.9,
      "end_time": 41.8,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 44.2,
      "end_time": 47.3,
      "text": "I understand... how you feel, Eris-san..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 48.2,
      "end_time": 49.0,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 49.5,
      "end_time": 50.5,
      "text": "Ugh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 52.6,
      "end_time": 54.1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 54.6,
      "end_time": 55.3,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 55.5,
      "end_time": 56.3,
      "text": "Yui!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 57.1,
      "end_time": 59.5,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 61.2,
      "end_time": 64.8,
      "text": "I really, truly do. For Kishi-kun..."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 65.0,
      "end_time": 66.8,
      "text": "I want him to only look at me."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 67.6,
      "end_time": 69.6,
      "text": "I want him to be by my side."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 70.0,
      "end_time": 72.6,
      "text": "I want to keep adventuring with him forever..."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 73.3,
      "end_time": 77.3,
      "text": "Besides, if my confession is rejected..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 77.5,
      "end_time": 80.0,
      "text": "I’m sure I wouldn’t be able to take it."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 80.4,
      "end_time": 82.1,
      "text": "Just like you are now."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 83.0,
      "end_time": 86.9,
      "text": "Because...you and I..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 88.6,
      "end_time": 90.3,
      "text": "KUSANO... YUI...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 91.9,
      "end_time": 95.1,
      "text": "Did you forget what you said...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 96.5,
      "end_time": 97.8,
      "text": "About what you are to me...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 98.1,
      "end_time": 99.4,
      "text": "...We're the same."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 100.0,
      "end_time": 102.0,
      "text": "I said that, didn't I..."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 103.1,
      "end_time": 108.5,
      "text": "I'm sorry. I really didn't understand anything..."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 110.0,
      "end_time": 111.6,
      "text": "I thought I knew it all."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 112.3,
      "end_time": 116.6,
      "text": "Since we're the same, I was sure we could understand each other..."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 118.1,
      "end_time": 123.4,
      "text": "But then I realized. We're not the same."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 124.2,
      "end_time": 126.3,
      "text": "The one similarity..."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 127.6,
      "end_time": 131.4,
      "text": "The one similarity we share, is the person we love."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 131.6,
      "end_time": 133.2,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 136.3,
      "end_time": 139.1,
      "text": "We fell in love with the same person."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 141.5,
      "end_time": 142.5,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 144.3,
      "end_time": 146.4,
      "text": "We haven't fallen for him in the same way."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start_time": 147.3,
      "end_time": 148.5,
      "text": "...Have we?"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start_time": 150.6,
      "end_time": 153.6,
      "text": "(For so long... I've been watching him...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start_time": 155.6,
      "end_time": 158.9,
      "text": "(Even if we can't touch each other directly...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start_time": 160.5,
      "end_time": 162.8,
      "text": "(No matter what Kishi-kun looks like...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start_time": 163.0,
      "end_time": 166.2,
      "text": "(Forever and ever... I was the only one...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start_time": 168.2,
      "end_time": 170.2,
      "text": "(That's why-)"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start_time": 171.2,
      "end_time": 173.6,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start_time": 175.1,
      "end_time": 176.7,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start_time": 179.1,
      "end_time": 182.4,
      "text": "...You've just realized this now."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start_time": 182.6,
      "end_time": 183.5,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start_time": 185.6,
      "end_time": 189.6,
      "text": "You truly are slow on the uptake.\nI'm stunned."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start_time": 190.6,
      "end_time": 192.3,
      "text": "Eris..."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start_time": 195.2,
      "end_time": 196.4,
      "text": "Kusano Yui"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start_time": 197.4,
      "end_time": 198.1,
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start_time": 198.3,
      "end_time": 199.5,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start_time": 200.6,
      "end_time": 202.2,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start_time": 204.0,
      "end_time": 205.1,
      "text": "...Focus."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start_time": 205.4,
      "end_time": 206.4,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start_time": 207.3,
      "end_time": 208.3,
      "text": "Leave it to me!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start_time": 213.1,
      "end_time": 215.2,
      "text": "Looks like they're ready!"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start_time": 216.6,
      "end_time": 218.6,
      "text": "Ah! You've made me wait too long!"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start_time": 220.5,
      "end_time": 222.5,
      "text": "Rei and Hiyori are separated!"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start_time": 222.9,
      "end_time": 224.5,
      "text": "Yui! Eris-san!"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start_time": 226.1,
      "end_time": 227.3,
      "text": "[Yes] [Yeah]"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start_time": 232.0,
      "end_time": 234.4,
      "text": "[...Hn!] [Haaaaah!!]"
    }
  ],
